WEBVTT

00:24:27.954 --> 00:24:31.496
an intuition how good you think
the soldier is going to be.

00:24:32.621 --> 00:24:39.371
When the data came back, it turned out
that that intuition at the end was

00:24:39.371 --> 00:24:41.163
the best single predictor.

00:24:41.871 --> 00:24:46.996
It was just as good as the average
or the sixth straight,

00:24:46.996 --> 00:24:51.246
and it added information. So, wow.

00:24:52.413 --> 00:24:57.288
You know, I was surprised, you know, I
just was doing that as a favor to them,

00:24:57.288 --> 00:25:01.954
letting them have intuitions. But
the discovery was very clear.